#. あ、霧切さん！
#. 今のアナウンスは聞いた？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, Kyoko! Did you hear the announcement just now?"
msgstr ""

#. …えぇ。
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr ""

#. 気は進まないけど…
#. 行くしかないんだよね？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I don't want to go, but...we don't have any other\n"
"choice, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ロクな事じゃないでしょうけど…
#. ここで逆らうのは得策じゃないわ…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I can't imagine it's going to be good news. But it's\n"
"not a good idea to defy him here and now..."
msgstr ""

#. …先に行くわね。
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So I'm going on ahead."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり…モノクマには従うしかないのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I really can't do anything except what Monokuma tells\n"
"me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おう、苗木。
#. オメェも行くところか…？
msgctxt "0007 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Hey, man. You about to head in?"
msgstr ""

#. うん…みんなは、もう行ってるのかな？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah. Has everyone already gone on ahead?"
msgstr ""

#. …だろうな。
msgctxt "0009 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Looks that way."
msgstr ""

#. 気にくわねーが、あのクマ野郎を無視しても
#. いい事はねぇだろうしな…
msgctxt "0010 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"I don't like it, but nothing good's gonna come from\n"
"ignoring that goddamn bear."
msgstr ""

#. あの、大和田クン…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um, Mondo...?"
msgstr ""

#. 体は大丈夫なの？
#. サウナで相当無理してたけど…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you're okay? You kinda went all-out in\n"
"that sauna..."
msgstr ""

#. あぁん？　誰が無理してたって？
#. あの程度の熱さ、へでもねぇんだよッ！
msgctxt "0013 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Huh? Who went all-out? That shit doesn't even faze me!"
msgstr ""

#. しかしよォ…
msgctxt "0014 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "But ya know..."
msgstr ""

#. 地獄の果てに兄弟の契りが待ってたとはな…
#. このオレにも予想がつかなかったぜ…
msgctxt "0015 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"There at the edge of hell...a promise between men was\n"
"waiting for me. Never saw it comin'..."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、それはともかく、
#. とっとと体育館に行くぞ…
msgctxt "0016 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Anyway! Let's get our asses into the gym."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当に…あの２人の間に
#. 何が起こったんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Man, something...unique must've happened between the\n"
"two of them.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>嫌な予感がするけど、早く<CLT><CLT 3>体育館<CLT><CLT 4>へ行こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have a bad feeling about this. But I'd better just\n"
"get it over with and get to the <CLT><CLT 3>gym<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

